1
00:00:00,716 --> 00:00:02,556
(Howard:)Really? Tell that
to the bathroom scale,

2
00:00:02,718 --> 00:00:04,928
(Howard:)'cause one of you is lying.

3
00:00:05,922 --> 00:00:09,392
(Bernadette:)Fine, forget I asked.
How was dinner at your mom's?

4
00:00:09,559 --> 00:00:12,939
(Howard:)Awful. I had to rub her ointment
all over her again.

5
00:00:13,095 --> 00:00:14,475
(Bernadette:)Why can't she do it?

6
00:00:14,630 --> 00:00:17,770
(Howard:)Cause we've got a deeply
unhealthy relationship.

7
00:00:19,001 --> 00:00:20,451
(Howard:)Which reminds me,

8
00:00:20,603 --> 00:00:22,913
(Howard:)do you think you can get
any samples of this from work?

9
00:00:23,072 --> 00:00:24,242
(Howard:)This was supposed
to last her a month,

10
00:00:24,407 --> 00:00:27,447
(Howard:)but they didn't take into account
the square footage of her back.

11
00:00:29,278 --> 00:00:30,988
(Bernadette:)Let me see.

12
00:00:32,114 --> 00:00:33,524
(Bernadette:)How long have you been
putting this on her?

13
00:00:33,683 --> 00:00:35,753
(Stuart:)I don't know.
Few weeks. Why?

14
00:00:35,918 --> 00:00:38,628
This is really strong estrogen cream.

15
00:00:38,788 --> 00:00:40,328
(Bernadette:)Please tell me
you've been wearing gloves.

16
00:00:40,489 --> 00:00:43,769
(Howard:)Like these swollen sausages
could fit in gloves.

17
00:00:44,961 --> 00:00:47,601
Howie, the estrogen's
getting absorbed by your skin.

18
00:00:47,763 --> 00:00:49,803
(Bernadette:)That's why you've been
all bloated and moody

19
00:00:49,966 --> 00:00:52,306
(Bernadette:)and a giant pain in the ass.

20
00:00:52,468 --> 00:00:55,608
You're full of estrogen
and you don't act like that.

21
00:00:55,771 --> 00:01:02,021
(Bernadette:)That's 'cause I'm a woman. I've had
years of practice riding the dragon.

